    <data name="GFM6_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Phew...[pause=0] those floors really took it out of me.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Look![pause=10] A peaceful clearing, with a Kangaskhan Rock!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_003" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>We can rest and save here before pressing into the depths.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_004" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The Gloomy Forest only gets darker from here...[pause=0] let's stay sharp.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_010" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Onward![pause=0] The depths await us.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_011" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This time,[pause=10] we won't falter.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_012" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Let's keep moving.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_020" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ugh...[pause=0] where are we?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_021" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Looks like the clearing has taken us in again...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_022" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Zarude overwhelmed us...[pause=0] but Chenipent is counting on us.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_023" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Let's catch our breath at the rock,[pause=10] then head back in.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_024" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The depths of the forest are unforgiving...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="GFM6_025" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>We have to press on,[pause=0] for Chenipent's sake.</value>
